  <h1>Free. Libre. Truly Free.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Free the code. Reward the stewards. Give people their time back.</p>
  <p>AI is making software cheap to write. We think that's good news, as long as the people who look after software can still earn a good living. Our idea: give the code away, and get paid for keeping it safe, reliable and useful. No hourly billing, no locked-up code, no trapped customers.</p>
